OL,3,GNEWSAFood aid charity under pressure
OL,4,Afrom fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FSoaring fuel prices are putting extra
OL,7,Fpressure on efforts to get food to
OL,8,Fthousands of people in need across
OL,9,FDevon and Cornwall, the South West's
OL,10,Flargest food redistribution charity has
OL,11,Fwarned.
OL,13,FFareShare South West said demand for
OL,14,Ffood support had risen by 45% since the
OL,15,FCovid-19 pandemic, while the cost of
OL,16,Fcollecting and delivering surplus food
OL,17,Fhad increased sharply.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
