OL,3,GNEWSAFood aid charity under pressure
OL,4,Afrom fuel costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity, which redistributes
OL,7,Fsurplus food to about 70 organisations
OL,8,Facross the region, said it was facing
OL,9,Fthe challenge of meeting growing demand
OL,10,Fwhile absorbing higher operating costs.
OL,12,FBosses added they were also concerned
OL,13,Fabout the impact on volunteers and
OL,14,Fstaff, many of whom were paying more to
OL,15,Ftravel to their shifts.
